{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - System - Event Types - Potential Okta Password in the Username Field",
	"Description": "The username submitted at sign-in does not look like a username: it has no @ and does not look like an Okta ID, but it does have the shape of a password. Users type their password into the username box, and when they do it lands in the System Log in cleartext and needs rotating.\n\nField: actor.alternateId\n\nReference(s):\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/api/openapi/okta-management/management/tag/SystemLog/",
